cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the accompanying manuscript, please cite them
  using the metadata below.
type: software
title: Generative Identifiability
abstract: >-
  Exact, enumerative measurements of how much of a generating rule an
  observation determines, and whether knowing the rule determines the
  system's behaviour. Covers expressions over {1,+,*}, the 256 elementary
  cellular automata, a family of hypergraph rewriting systems, and a
  pre-registered enumeration of all 1,500,625 four-state partially observed
  Markov chains.
